select null, t.id, 'builtin', 'The reagent strip glucose test is based on:', '["Copper reduction","Glucose oxidase reaction","Protein error of indicators","Diazo reaction"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The strip glucose pad uses glucose oxidase, and no urine components are known to cause false-positive glucose oxidase reactions. Copper reduction is the Clinitest principle; diazo is for bilirubin. Reference: Delanghe & Speeckaert, Preanalytical requirements of urinalysis, Biochem Med 2014 (pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3936984).', 1, 'verified'
